# Qwen3.8-27B (preserve-thinking), full fine-tuning at 128K context: the fcs-q38 gateway, as rasp's
# launch/abci/submit.sh submits it for frontiercs-* (production run fcs10-q38-nonrec-...-v25). One difference: the
# gateway advertises the Hugging Face id, not the snapshot path, so a trainer config names
# `model_name: apurvaga/Qwen3.8-27B-preserve-thinking`.
# Layout: TP4 training, so DP = 2 x TRAIN_NODES (TRAIN_NODES=5 on 10 nodes is fcs-q38's TP4 x DP10), and one TP8
# SGLang engine per other node. The head node (Ray head, driver, gateway, client) is always one of the engine nodes,
# so trainer rank 0, which sends the weight pushes, never shares a node with the client and its sandboxes.
# The engines' HTTP keep-alive comes from miles (SGLANG_TIMEOUT_KEEP_ALIVE=600 for every engine it launches), so
# the one --extra-env-vars below stays free for the NCCL logs.
# Use: qsub -v PRESET=qwen3.8-27b-128k,TRAIN_NODES=5,... deploy/abci/tinker_gateway.pbs
# tinker_gateway.pbs reads this file (it never sources it); a non-empty job variable replaces a value here.
GATEWAY_LAUNCHER=examples/tinker/run_qwen3_6_35b_a3b_gateway.py
MODE=full
# The snapshot under $HF_HOME/hub (HF_SNAPSHOT, when given, wins).
HF_MODEL=apurvaga/Qwen3.8-27B-preserve-thinking
HF_REVISION=97c725615b8aa025b800da4ceed38811358b30f1
# Launcher options: NCCL logs at INFO, the dense 27b recipe (TP4/EP1 training, TP8 engines) with no routing replay
# (no experts), datums of up to 131072 + 1 tokens, one per GPU microbatch, and units of ten such datums.
LAUNCHER_ARGS="--extra-env-vars NCCL_DEBUG=INFO --model-variant 27b --model-name apurvaga/Qwen3.8-27B-preserve-thinking --no-routing-replay --tp 4 --context-len 131072 --max-tokens-per-gpu 131073 --max-tokens-per-datum 131073 --unit-token-budget 1310730"
# serve_tinker.py flags, appended last: FA3 attention on the engines, the optimizer's initial lr (every optim_step
# sends its own), and the cache-aware router with fcs-q38's load-balance thresholds.
EXTRA_ARGS="--sglang-attention-backend fa3 --lr 1e-6 --router-policy cache_aware --router-balance-abs-threshold 16 --router-balance-rel-threshold 1.5"
# The client's deadline for one sample request, in seconds: long thinking generations at 128K outlast platoon's 600.
TINKER_SAMPLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=1800
